{"metadata":{"title":"StreamControlsGroup","externalID":"s:8Headwire19StreamControlsGroupV","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Headwire"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StreamControlsGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StreamControlsGroup","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwire\/streamcontrolsgroup"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The stream’s buttons in a row with the chevron at its trailing end: folded, only the chevron","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and anything always in sight, such as a recording’s indicator; open, the buttons grow out","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toward the leading edge and shrink back into the chevron; while the Mac is in use, the chevron","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dimmed as the other controls are when idle, or with Hide controls completely on, only what is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always in sight.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/init(visibility:showsChevron:isDimmed:hasInput:onChevron:pinned:buttons:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/body","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/buttons","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/hasInput","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/isDimmed","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwire\/StreamControlsGroup\/onChevron","doc:\/\/com.nth.headwire\/documentation\/Headwi